From 48869c5285f47f5d791cbbbd22b63b4b475a359a Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Edukasaun OS <hugomonizdorego@angelinojoana.com>
Date: Wed, 30 Sep 2026 19:18:04 +0900
Subject: [PATCH 1/3] Eduka-Orca: slower, lower speech and on-screen captions
 by default

For Edukasaun OS users who are hard of hearing:
- default speech rate 30 (upstream 50) and pitch 4.5 (upstream 5.0)
- speech monitor (captions) enabled by default, persisted in GSettings,
  24pt yellow-on-black, docked at the bottom, never steals focus,
  newest caption in bold; checkbox in Preferences > On-screen display
- Tetum locale uses a European Portuguese voice (no eSpeak NG Tetum)
- defaults centralised in orca/eduka_defaults.py with unit tests

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01KtDnhykBZ6mr4wBxEvfHXz
